                    <li>Acela Business represents good value for business travelers, with the time savings and premium amenities justifying the moderate premium over Regional.</li>
                    <li>Acela First is a luxury experience comparable to domestic first-class air travel, ideal for special occasions or when productivity is paramount.</li>
                    <li>The route's high frequency means travelers have abundant opportunities to find deals, but peak slots and Acela trains still sell out or rise in price during busy periods.</li>
